AI-BUILT MODIFICATIONS
----------------------

The Simplified Chinese localization layer in this fork — including the
build-time Babel transform, the runtime dictionary/overlay, the extraction and
translation tooling, the zh-CN catalog, and the fork documentation — was
generated entirely by AI coding agents working against the upstream Paperclip
source tree.

The upstream Paperclip project itself was written by Paperclip AI and its
contributors; it is not AI-generated by this fork.

The zh-CN translations are machine-generated and have not been reviewed
line-by-line by a human. Wording, terminology, and tone may be inconsistent.
See I18N-AGENT-GUIDE.md for how the catalog is produced and maintained.

Modifications introduced by this fork:

  - Added a Simplified Chinese (zh-CN) localization overlay for the web UI.
  - Added a build-time Babel transform (ui/scripts/babel-plugin-paperclip-zh.cjs)
    that routes JSX copy through a runtime dictionary lookup.
  - Added the zh-CN catalog at ui/src/i18n/zh-CN.overlay.json and the tooling
    to extract and (re)translate UI strings.

